secubox-annuaire (0.2.4-1~bookworm1) bookworm; urgency=medium

  * fix(#768): satellite Annuaire dashboards. The legacy nginx vhost
    (sites-available/secubox) includes secubox.d/ but not secubox-routes.d/, so
    the dashboard's /api/v1/annuaire/ calls fell through to the SPA shell (empty
    UI on non-hub nodes). postinst now drops the API route into secubox.d/ on
    those nodes (idempotent, nginx -t validated, reverted on failure); hub nodes
    whose active config already includes secubox-routes.d are left untouched.

